{"book":10,"chapter":5,"rubric":"LEARNING RUST / GETTING TO KNOW RUST / CHAPTER 5","slides":[{"title":"Decisions and repetition","sub":"Chapter 5 · if, loops, match","short":"Introduction","main":"if and match choose; loop, while, for repeat; block braces are required.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Branching","Loops","Blocks and braces"],"captions":["if and else make decisions; match chooses by pattern","Three loops: loop — endless, while — by condition, for — over a sequence","Indentation means nothing, braces are required; no parentheses around the condition"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":60.0,"w":130.0,"h":34.0,"text":"if / else","tone":"blue","size":12.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":270.0,"y":60.0,"w":130.0,"h":34.0,"text":"match","tone":"green","size":12.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a0","x":70.0,"y":60.0,"w":90.0,"h":34.0,"text":"loop","tone":"green","size":12.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"a1","x":180.0,"y":60.0,"w":90.0,"h":34.0,"text":"while","tone":"green","size":12.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"a2","x":290.0,"y":60.0,"w":90.0,"h":34.0,"text":"for","tone":"green","size":12.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":30.0,"y":36.0,"lines":["if x > 0 {","    println!(\"plus\");","}"],"hl":[0],"lang":"rust","size":13.0,"lh":24.0,"w":300.0}]],"cues":[14.0,25.3]}]},{"title":"if and else if","sub":"Condition — bool only","short":"if","main":"No parentheses around the condition; checked top to bottom.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["if","else if","Order"],"captions":["if cond { … } — the condition must be bool, no parentheses around it","Extra branches — else if; finally else for all the remaining cases","Branches are checked top to bottom; the first match runs"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":30.0,"y":36.0,"lines":["if temp > 30 {","    println!(\"hot\");","}"],"hl":[0],"lang":"rust","size":13.0,"lh":24.0,"w":300.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":30.0,"lines":["if n < 0 {","    println!(\"minus\");","} else if n == 0 {","    println!(\"zero\");","} else {","    println!(\"plus\");","}"],"hl":[2,4],"lang":"rust","size":10.5,"lh":18.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":40.0,"lines":["if n > 0 { \"plus\" }","else if n > 10 { \"many\" }   // unreachable"],"hl":[1],"lang":"rust","size":10.5,"lh":26.0,"w":340.0},{"t":"text","id":"t","x":180.0,"y":120.0,"text":"narrower condition first","size":10.0}]],"cues":[10.2,25.6]}]},{"title":"if is an expression","sub":"Branch value","short":"if as an expression","main":"Branches share a type; without else the value is ().","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Branch value","One type","No else"],"captions":["let sign = if x > 0 { 1 } else { -1 }; — the value of the branch that ran is taken","Both branches share a type: mixing numbers and strings is an error","if without else is always () — no value to get"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":30.0,"y":40.0,"lines":["let sign = if x > 0 {","    1","} else { -1 };"],"hl":[1],"lang":"rust","size":12.0,"lh":22.0,"w":300.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":40.0,"lines":["let v = if ok { 1 } else { \"no\" };","// ✕ if and else have incompatible types"],"hl":[0],"bad":[0],"lang":"rust","size":10.0,"lh":26.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":40.0,"lines":["let v = if ok { 5 };","// ✕ `if` may be missing an `else` clause"],"hl":[0],"bad":[0],"lang":"rust","size":10.5,"lh":26.0,"w":340.0}]],"cues":[7.6,22.3]}]},{"title":"loop","sub":"Endless loop","short":"loop","main":"Exit with break; break can return a value.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Endless","break","break with a value"],"captions":["loop { … } repeats the body again and again","Exit — break; the body often contains an if with the exit condition","break value; makes the loop itself an expression: let r = loop { … break 42; };"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":30.0,"y":36.0,"lines":["loop {","    println!(\"tick\");","}"],"hl":[0],"lang":"rust","size":13.0,"lh":24.0,"w":300.0},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":120.0,"text":"↻ forever","size":11.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":30.0,"lines":["let mut n = 0;","loop {","    n += 1;","    if n == 3 { break; }","}"],"hl":[3],"lang":"rust","size":11.0,"lh":20.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":30.0,"lines":["let mut n = 0;","let r = loop {","    n += 1;","    if n * n > 50 { break n; }","};   // r == 8"],"hl":[3],"lang":"rust","size":10.5,"lh":20.0,"w":340.0}]],"cues":[9.2,27.1]}]},{"title":"while","sub":"While true","short":"while","main":"The condition is checked before every step; remember to change the counter.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Check before the step","Changing the counter","Hanging"],"captions":["while cond { … } — while the condition is true, as in Python, but no colon","The loop variable is mut; change it with += or -=","If nothing changes in the body, the condition stays true forever"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":30.0,"lines":["let mut n = 3;","while n > 0 {","    println!(\"{n}\");","    n -= 1;","}"],"hl":[1],"lang":"rust","size":11.0,"lh":20.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":66.0,"w":80.0,"h":34.0,"text":"n = 3","tone":"blue","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":112.0,"y1":66.0,"x2":148.0,"y2":66.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":180.0,"y":66.0,"w":70.0,"h":34.0,"text":"n = 2","tone":"blue","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":218.0,"y1":66.0,"x2":254.0,"y2":66.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"c~cell","x":286.0,"y":66.0,"w":70.0,"h":34.0,"text":"n = 1","tone":"blue","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":40.0,"lines":["let n = 3;","while n > 0 {","    println!(\"{n}\");   // forever","}"],"hl":[1,2],"bad":[2],"lang":"rust","size":11.0,"lh":22.0,"w":340.0}]],"cues":[11.9,27.9]}]},{"title":"for and ranges","sub":"a..b and a..=b","short":"for","main":"0..n without the right bound, 0..=n with it; rev and step_by.","body":[{