acters, elements and \"index — value\" pairs.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Characters","Elements","enumerate"],"captions":["for c in s.chars() — the characters of a string one by one","for x in &v — the elements of a vector or array in turn","for (i, x) in v.iter().enumerate() — \"index and element\" pairs, as in Python"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":30.0,"y":40.0,"lines":["for c in \"hello\".chars() {","    println!(\"{c}\");","}"],"hl":[0],"lang":"rust","size":12.0,"lh":24.0,"w":300.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":30.0,"y":40.0,"lines":["let v = [10, 20, 30];","for x in &v {","    println!(\"{x}\");","}"],"hl":[1],"lang":"rust","size":12.0,"lh":22.0,"w":300.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":40.0,"lines":["for (i, x) in v.iter().enumerate() {","    println!(\"{i}: {x}\");","}"],"hl":[0],"lang":"rust","size":10.5,"lh":24.0,"w":340.0}]],"cues":[13.1,28.4]}]},{"title":"break, continue, labels","sub":"Loop control","short":"Control","main":"break exits, continue skips; labels exit nested loops.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["break","continue","Labels"],"captions":["break ends the loop completely","continue skips the rest of the body and goes to the next step; a loop has no else branch, unlike Python","The label 'outer: for … and break 'outer; leave nested loops at once"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":30.0,"lines":["for i in 0..10 {","    if i == 3 { break; }","    println!(\"{i}\");   // 0 1 2","}"],"hl":[1],"lang":"rust","size":10.5,"lh":22.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":30.0,"lines":["for i in 0..5 {","    if i % 2 == 0 { continue; }","    println!(\"{i}\");   // 1 3","}"],"hl":[1],"lang":"rust","size":10.5,"lh":22.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":30.0,"lines":["'outer: for i in 0..5 {","    for j in 0..5 {","        if i * j == 6 { break 'outer; }","    }","}"],"hl":[0,2],"lang":"rust","size":10.5,"lh":20.0,"w":340.0}]],"cues":[9.9,20.9]}]},{"title":"Four patterns","sub":"Sum, count, max, search","short":"Patterns","main":"Accumulator, counter, maximum and search with break.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Sum and count","Maximum","Search"],"captions":["Accumulator: sum = 0 and sum += x; counter: count += 1 when the condition holds","Maximum: take the first value and compare with each next one","Search: go through the values and exit with break when found"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":30.0,"lines":["let mut sum = 0;","for x in 1..=5 {","    sum += x;","}   // 15"],"hl":[0,2],"lang":"rust","size":11.0,"lh":22.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":30.0,"lines":["let mut best = v[0];","for &x in &v {","    if x > best { best = x; }","}"],"hl":[0,2],"lang":"rust","size":11.0,"lh":22.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":30.0,"lines":["let mut found = false;","for &x in &v {","    if x == 7 { found = true; break; }","}"],"hl":[0,2],"lang":"rust","size":10.5,"lh":22.0,"w":340.0}]],"cues":[12.7,27.6]}]},{"title":"match","sub":"Choosing by pattern","short":"match","main":"Patterns, | and ranges, _ ; all cases required.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Patterns","Ranges and _","Exhaustive check"],"captions":["match value { pattern => result, … } — choose by pattern; match is an expression too","2 | 3 — several options, 4..=9 — a range, _ — everything else","The compiler requires every case to be covered: a missing variant is a build error"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":30.0,"lines":["match n {","    1 => \"one\",","    2 | 3 => \"two-three\",","    _ => \"other\",","}"],"hl":[1,2],"lang":"rust","size":11.0,"lh":20.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":30.0,"lines":["match n {","    0 => \"zero\",","    1..=9 => \"digit\",","    _ => \"bigger\",","}"],"hl":[2,3],"lang":"rust","size":11.0,"lh":20.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":36.0,"lines":["match n {","    0 => \"zero\",","    1 => \"one\",","}   // ✕ non-exhaustive patterns"],"hl":[3],"bad":[3],"lang":"rust","size":10.5,"lh":22.0,"w":340.0}]],"cues":[17.6,32.0]}]},{"title":"Traps","sub":"Common mistakes","short":"Traps","main":"Off by one, usize − 1, = instead of ==.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Off-by-one","usize − 1","= instead of =="],"captions":["0..n excludes n: to get the last one write 0..=n; off-by-one is the most common error","usize is never negative: 0usize − 1 is a panic in debug (attempt to subtract with overflow)","if x = 5 is an assignment, not a comparison: types won't match, the build stops"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":60.0,"w":130.0,"h":34.0,"text":"1..5 → 1,2,3,4","tone":"red","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":270.0,"y":60.0,"w":130.0,"h":34.0,"text":"1..=5 → 1,…,5","tone":"green","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":30.0,"y":50.0,"lines":["let i: usize = 0;","let j = i - 1;   // panic!"],"hl":[1],"bad":[1],"lang":"rust","size":12.0,"lh":24.0,"w":300.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":40.0,"lines":["if x = 5 { }   // ✕ expected bool, found ()","if x == 5 { }   // ✓"],"hl":[0],"bad":[0],"lang":"rust","size":10.0,"lh":26.0,"w":340.0}]],"cues":[16.6,26.1]}]},{"title":"After Python","sub":"What changed","short":"After Python","main":"range → .., elif → else if, while True → loop; no truthy.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Loops","Conditions","What's missing"],"captions":["for i in range(n) → for i in 0..n; while True → loop; break can carry a value","elif → else if; ternary → if–else as an expression; match-case → match","No truthy values and no else on loops; but there are loop labels"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":60.0,"w":130.0,"h":34.0,"text":"range(n)","tone":"muted","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":270.0,"y":60.0,"w":130.0,"h":34.0,"text":"0..n","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":60.0,"w":130.0,"h":34.0,"text":"elif","tone":"muted","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":270.0,"y":60.0,"w":130.0,"h":34.0,"text":"else if","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":60.0,"w":130.0,"h":34.0,"text":"if \"\" / if 0","tone":"muted","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":270.0,"y":60.0,"w":130.0,"h":34.0,"text":"bool only","tone":"green","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[9.7,23.1]}]},{"title":"Summary","sub":"What's next","short":"Summary","main":"Next — strings.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Remember","Cheat sheet","Next"],"captions":["if — bool only and an expression; loop, while, for; 0..n and 0..=n; break and continue; match needs all cases","Accumulator, counter, maximum, search — four patterns you will write often","Next chapter — strings: String and &str, joining, splitting and iterating"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a0","x":50.0,"y":66.0,"w":76.0,"h":30.0,"text":"if","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"a1","x":136.0,"y":66.0,"w":76.0,"h":30.0,"text":"loop","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"a2","x":222.0,"y":66.0,"w":76.0,"h":30.0,"text":"while","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"a3","x":308.0,"y":66.0,"w":76.0,"h":30.0,"text":"for","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":30.0,"lines":["let mut sum = 0;","for i in 1..=n {","    if i % 2 == 0 { sum += i; }","}"],"hl":[2],"lang":"rust","size":11.0,"lh":22.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":180.0,"y":60.0,"w":220.0,"h":34.0,"text":"String · &str · format!","tone":"blue","size":11.5,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[12.8,22.8]}]}]}